### Buat order (memanggil catalog-service dan pricing-stub)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 7,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 15, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 23, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Produk tidak aktif (422): produk 70 berstatus INACTIVE pada seed
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 7, "items": [ { "productId": 70, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Riwayat order pelanggan besar
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/customers/1/orders?page=0&size=5

### Token pricing (langsung ke stub)
POST http://localhost:8083/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=order-service&client_secret=x
